  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>La verbera del Rosc&oacute;n de Reyes ha culminado esta madrugada el Nadal Musical en el pabell&oacute;n Vila d&#39;Onda, promovido por el Consell de Festes.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/01/IMG_6589.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La m&uacute;sica ha corrido a cargo de la orquesta Liverpool, con una&nbsp; montaje muy espectacular sobre un cami&oacute;n escenario en el que se proyectaban im&aacute;genes. Unas 3.000 personas habr&aacute; pasado por el pabell&oacute;n Vila d&#39;Onda, que comenz&oacute; a animarse a partir de las 3.15 horas, momento al que pertenecen las fotos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/verbenaroscon/img_6591.jpg\" alt=\"img_6591\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/verbenaroscon/img_6592.jpg\" alt=\"img_6592\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/verbenaroscon/img_6593.jpg\" alt=\"img_6593\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/verbenaroscon/img_6594.jpg\" alt=\"img_6594\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/verbenaroscon/img_6595.jpg\" alt=\"img_6595\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/verbenaroscon/img_6596.jpg\" alt=\"img_6596\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/verbenaroscon/img_6597.jpg\" alt=\"img_6597\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/verbenaroscon/img_6598.jpg\" alt=\"img_6598\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/verbenaroscon/img_6599.jpg\" alt=\"img_6599\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/verbenaroscon/img_6600.jpg\" alt=\"img_6600\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
